Subject: [PATCH 20/21] ttf: leave out a name record that does not decode

skrifa reads a name record in an encoding it does not decode (MacJapanese) as an
empty string, which the reader kept as that language's name: Shippori Mincho's
Japanese family name became "" under "ja" (the Windows record, which decodes, is
"ja-JP"). An empty decoded name is now left out.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
